Skills and Experience &nbsp;

• Experience: 5+ years of experience in strategic media planning, addressable creative strategy, audience strategy, digital activation, or creative strategy within an agency or marketing technology environment. &nbsp;

• Strategic &amp; Consumer-Centric: Expert at connecting data signals to consumer behavior, culture, and business outcomes. Deep understanding of dynamic messaging frameworks and audience segmentation models. &nbsp;

• Addressable &amp; Tech Literate: Working knowledge of Dynamic Creative Optimization (DCO) platforms (e.g., Clinch, Innovid - formerly known as Flashtalking, Celtra, Smartly), ad servers, and addressable media channels. &nbsp;

• Analytical Mindset: Skilled at translating complex campaign data and creative performance outputs into clear, narrative-driven client recommendations. &nbsp;

• Collaborative Communicator: Outstanding presentation and workshop facilitation skills, capable of bridging conversations between data engineers, media planners, creative teams, and senior brand managers. &nbsp;

• Innovative Thinker: Passionate about emerging media technology, agentic workflows, AI content generation, and modern content ecosystems. &nbsp;

• Language Skills: Professional proficiency in both Spanish and English for seamless cross-border collaboration across the Mexico Hub and global accounts. &nbsp;

